            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a list of date types that you can use with tasks, such as `Actual Close Date` and `Task Due Date`. These are the options that appear in the **Due Date** drop-down list when you create a task by using the console.\n\n**Note:** You do not enter an `accountId` with this method.\n\n## Permissions\n\nAny user with a valid access token can use this method.",
